flowchart LR
  M[Microbe: signal to response] --> I[Insect: competing signals]
  I --> B[Bird: multiple information sources]
  B --> H[Human: confusion becomes conscious]
  H --> S[Society: collective uncertainty]
  S --> C[Civilization: cities]
  C --> E[Earth: feedback loops]
  E --> SS[Solar system: trajectories]
  SS --> G[Galaxy: stars, gas, dark matter]
  G --> U[Universe: cosmic web]
  M -.->|confusion| W1[uncertainty]
  S -.-> W2[complexity]
  U -.-> W3[emergence]
